    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "leg_why_title",
      "x": 810,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 20,
      "text": "Why are NOT SAVED fields there?",
      "originalText": "Why are NOT SAVED fields there?",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#003366",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 7074,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8074,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "leg_why_body",
      "x": 810,
      "y": 292,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "They exist so the UI can display them.\nThe user needs to see \"John Smith\"\nand \"Brake Pads\" and \"$49.98\".\n\nBut the database already has those\nvalues in the Customer and Part\ntables — so we don't save them\nagain. The BLL simply ignores them.",
      "originalText": "They exist so the UI can display them.\nThe user needs to see \"John Smith\"\nand \"Brake Pads\" and \"$49.98\".\n\nBut the database already has those\nvalues in the Customer and Part\ntables — so we don't save them\nagain. The BLL simply ignores them.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 7075,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8075,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },

    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "bottom_msg",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 815,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 50,
      "text": "The view model carries EVERYTHING the page needs — but only the database columns get saved back.\nDisplay values and computed fields ride along for the UI, then get ignored by the BLL on save.",
      "originalText": "The view model carries EVERYTHING the page needs — but only the database columns get saved back.\nDisplay values and computed fields ride along for the UI, then get ignored by the BLL on save.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#003366",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
